DS5Dongle -- https://github.com/awalol/DS5Dongle

prototype/ds5bridge/protocol.py:build_report_39() is a hand-written Python port
of the Bluetooth output report 0x39 packet layout in src/audio.cpp
(audio_bt_task), and prototype/ds5bridge/audio.py's Opus parameters follow the
encoder configuration in the same file.

